{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16913","headline":"八月十五夜与诸公锦楼望月得中字 · 武元衡","name":"八月十五夜与诸公锦楼望月得中字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉轮初满空，迥出锦城东。\n相向秦楼镜，分飞碣石鸿。\n桂香随窈窕，珠缀隔玲珑。\n不及前秋月，圆辉凤沼中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"武元衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16913.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16913","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}